sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Praxis Agent / Cell
    participant SliceSvc as PraxisSliceAuditService
    participant DiffStream as scanDiffStream
    participant MultiSvc as PraxisMultiAgentGovernanceService
    participant Ring as CircularDiffBuffer (R4)
    participant Rollback as PraxisRollbackEngine

    Agent->>SliceSvc: 1. Inner-loop edit -> auditAgentSlice(input)
    SliceSvc-->>Agent: Sub-10ms CAPP Prompt + Sparse MoE Plan
    Agent->>DiffStream: 2. Submit patch -> scanDiffStream(inputs)
    DiffStream->>Ring: 3. Push enriched ReviewDiffHunk (evict oldest to R4 Uint8Array)
    DiffStream->>Rollback: 4. Record TaskCard hunk anchor
    Agent->>MultiSvc: 5. Cell merge gate -> reviewMultiAgentPatches(patches)
    alt Collision or GOV-AGN-001 Cycle Detected
        MultiSvc->>Rollback: 6a. Trigger revertCard(cardId) atomic LIFO rollback
    else Approved
        MultiSvc-->>Agent: 6b. Merge to Cell Branch & update Trajectory Learning
    end
